<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8531] NPE is thrown on destroying empty partition</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8531</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Improvement &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8320&quot; title=&quot;Page corruption during the rebalancing cache.&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-8320&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-8320&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; introduced situation when NPE may happen: in case of destroying empty partition checkpoint record isn&apos;t logged to WAL but code attempts to create checkpoint marker anyway which leads to NPE.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need to allow checkpointing empty partitions.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
